               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Had to restructure how we store libraries/headers (well - easier) in Builds/CONFIGNAME/ThirdPartyLibs/ - so we can use pkg_config tool/scripts. That is what building curl depended on (or made easier). Maybe another way, but that was easist I could see.",
